---
description: Security rules for the sample todo app
alwaysApply: true
---

- Never write, log, or echo secrets, API keys, or production credentials
- No eval on user input under any circumstances
- No html_safe or raw on untrusted input
- Use parameterized queries only; never string-interpolate SQL
- Do not disable CSRF protection
- Do not disable mass assignment protection (never use permit!)
- Do not disable Devise session checks
- Never commit .env files or config/master.key
